# HUD SIZE at LARGEST — the desktop Options row for big or far-away
# screens (field: a 4K display). steam1_level1's scene with the HUD scale
# at its top step (1.75), for checking that the enlarged rows (LEVEL,
# score, weapons, lives, the bottom hint) still keep clear of each other
# on a 16:9 full-width viewport. Overlay::hud_grow caps the factor per
# viewport, so the same `hud_size 1.75` line on the 2P co-op scene renders
# the strips at 1.24 and the 2x2 grid untouched: that cap, not this scene,
# is the split-screen check.
size 1920 1080
seed 21
sim 1300
game 0
hud_size 1.75
camera fixed
ship 0 -100 20
hold w 100
hold space 300
asteroid -350 750 r=95 v=-20,-40
asteroid 800 450 tough r=110 v=-25,-10
asteroid 650 -400 r=70 v=-30,20
asteroid -700 -350 r=60 v=15,25
asteroid -950 250 r=75 v=25,-15
